</item><item><title><![CDATA[WhatsApp extortion in Calgary: Woman gets threats, then gunman fires at her home; 3 charged]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134148427.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/whatsapp-extortion-in-calgary-woman-gets-threats-then-gunman-fires-at-her-home-3-charged/articleshow/134148427.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/whatsapp-extortion-in-calgary-woman-gets-threats-then-gunman-fires-at-her-home-3-charged/articleshow/134148427.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T23:20:14+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134148778,imgsize-56464.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In 2002, a Maine mother went into labor during a 9/11 memorial; 24 years later, she reunited...]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134081580.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In a heartwarming twist of fate, a Maine mother, Maddie Marks, and firefighter Robert Shay Jr. have rekindled their bond nearly twenty-five years after an extraordinary roadside delivery during a 9/11 memorial service. This unexpected reunion in 2026, facilitated by mutual friends, allowed them to reflect on the emotional weight of that significant day, bringing closure and a shared sense of nostalgia for their remarkable journey.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2002-a-maine-mother-went-into-labor-during-a-9/11-memorial-24-years-later-she-reunited-with-the-firefighter-who-delivered-her-son/articleshow/134081580.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2002-a-maine-mother-went-into-labor-during-a-9/11-memorial-24-years-later-she-reunited-with-the-firefighter-who-delivered-her-son/articleshow/134081580.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T23:14:47+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134084872,imgsize-1061554.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In the 1850s, pigs brought to Santa Cruz Island became feral]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134085017.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Feral pigs were eradicated from Santa Cruz Island, facilitating a resurgence in fox populations. With bald eagles no longer in the area, golden eagles preyed on the island's foxes. In response, conservationists captured the golden eagles and reintroduced the native bald eagles. A captive breeding initiative safeguarded the remaining island foxes from predators, resulting in a successful revival of the island's native wildlife and ecosystem.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/in-the-1850s-pigs-brought-to-santa-cruz-island-became-feral-golden-eagles-drawn-by-piglets-helped-drive-foxes-down-95-then-5036-pigs-were-removed-as-foxes-rebounded-to-1300/articleshow/134085017.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/in-the-1850s-pigs-brought-to-santa-cruz-island-became-feral-golden-eagles-drawn-by-piglets-helped-drive-foxes-down-95-then-5036-pigs-were-removed-as-foxes-rebounded-to-1300/articleshow/134085017.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T23:14:42+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134085466,imgsize-1789903.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[From Iraq to Yemen: How Iran-linked groups are putting Saudi energy routes under pressure]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134144723.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Saudi Arabia temporarily shut its East-West oil pipeline after a drone attack. This vital energy conduit transports millions of barrels of crude oil daily. The attack has increased pressure on Iraq and raised global supply concerns. Houthi rebels in Yemen have also advanced along the Red Sea route. These events disrupt major energy and shipping routes worldwide.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/from-iraq-to-yemen-how-iran-linked-groups-are-putting-saudi-energy-routes-under-pressure/articleshow/134144723.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/from-iraq-to-yemen-how-iran-linked-groups-are-putting-saudi-energy-routes-under-pressure/articleshow/134144723.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T22:28:24+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134145645,imgsize-1027781.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Trump opens 2.93M acres at Bears Ears, Grand Staircase-Escalante to new mining claims on September 11]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134141776.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In July 2026, Donald Trump removed monument protections from about 2.93 million acres at Bears Ears and Grand Staircase-Escalante in Utah. On September 11, the excluded lands became eligible for new mining claims and certain mineral activities, following the 60-day period set by presidential proclamations. The move has drawn criticism from conservation groups and advocates.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-july-2026-trump-removed-monument-protections-from-2-93-million-acres-at-bears-ears-and-grand-staircase-escalante-on-september-11-the-excluded-lands-became-eligible-for-new-mining-claims/articleshow/134141776.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-july-2026-trump-removed-monument-protections-from-2-93-million-acres-at-bears-ears-and-grand-staircase-escalante-on-september-11-the-excluded-lands-became-eligible-for-new-mining-claims/articleshow/134141776.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T21:28:57+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134142113,imgsize-143102.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Indian-origin man sentenced to 5 years in US for running $27m-tax fraud scheme, helped clients dodge taxes]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134138554.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/indian-origin-man-sentenced-to-5-years-in-us-for-running-27m-tax-fraud-scheme-helped-clients-dodge-taxes/articleshow/134138554.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/indian-origin-man-sentenced-to-5-years-in-us-for-running-27m-tax-fraud-scheme-helped-clients-dodge-taxes/articleshow/134138554.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T22:13:28+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134144906,imgsize-698627.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Do we want to deport foreign doctors? Immigration firm CEO asks if US is ready to lose medical professionals, AI engineers by removing 60-day grace period]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.ind